                                                "sense_id": "cfce8280-cad0-35ca-882d-4e0f2020e7e7",
                                                "text": "The appearance of the entire tomb is as if the warrior had seen the vision of Christ in his dying moments, and had fallen back peacefully upon his pillow, with his eyes still turned to it, and his hands clasped in prayer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
